{
    "title": "\ub9ac\ub514 - \uc6f9\ud230, \ub9cc\ud654, \uc6f9\uc18c\uc124, \uc804\uc790\ucc45 \ubaa8\ub450 \uc5ec\uae30\uc5d0!",
    "description": "\u00a0Webtoons and web novels that will suit your tastes\r\n- Wait for popular webtoons and web novels for free!\r\n- The most popular works at a glance with real-time rankings!\r\n- Register your favorite works as favorites and read them comfortably.\r\n\r\n\u25aa Korea\u2019s largest e-book service\r\n- The latest popular works, business economics, self-help books, as well as comics and magazines!\r\n- We suggest books that perfectly suit your tastes through data-based recommendations.\r\n- If you are worried about purchasing, you can also rent it.\r\n\r\n\u25aa Enjoy Ridi Select for 4,900 won per month\r\n- Unlimited everything from bestsellers to the latest works!\r\n\r\n\u25aa The best viewer that is easy to read and listen to\r\n- You can choose the brightness, font size and font, and even the book background color.\r\n- Immerse yourself in the story with the listening function (TTS).\r\n- Share good sentences and images that are difficult to keep to yourself.\r\n\r\n\u203b Contact us\r\n- Email: help@ridi.com\r\n- Customer Center: https://help.ridibooks.com\r\n- Main number: 1644-0331\r\n\r\n\u203b Required access permission information\r\n- Device status and ID (only used for Android versions 6.0 and below): Used to improve usability\r\n- Address Book (only used under Android version 3.0): Used to send push notifications\r\n- Storage space: Used to store book files and reading records\r\n\r\n\u203b Optional access permission information\r\nYou can use the service even if you do not agree to the access rights.\r\nFor users under Android 6.0, the OS does not support individual consent for access rights.\r\n- Files and media (photos/videos/files): Used for adding user fonts, e-book files, sharing images, etc.\r\n- Phone (outgoing call route switching): Used to automatically resume listening (TTS) function after the call ends.\r\n- Notifications (Android version 13.0 or higher only): Used to notify events, benefits, work download completion, etc.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u00a0Webtoons and web novels that will suit your tastes<br>- Wait for popular webtoons and web novels for free!<br>- The most popular works at a glance with real-time rankings!<br>- Register your favorite works as favorites and read them comfortably.<br><br>\u25aa Korea\u2019s largest e-book service<br>- The latest popular works, business economics, self-help books, as well as comics and magazines!<br>- We suggest books that perfectly suit your tastes through data-based recommendations.<br>- If you are worried about purchasing, you can also rent it.<br><br>\u25aa Enjoy Ridi Select for 4,900 won per month<br>- Unlimited everything from bestsellers to the latest works!<br><br>\u25aa The best viewer that is easy to read and listen to<br>- You can choose the brightness, font size and font, and even the book background color.<br>- Immerse yourself in the story with the listening function (TTS).<br>- Share good sentences and images that are difficult to keep to yourself.<br><br>\u203b Contact us<br>- Email: help@ridi.com<br>- Customer Center: https://help.ridibooks.com<br>- Main number: 1644-0331<br><br>\u203b Required access permission information<br>- Device status and ID (only used for Android versions 6.0 and below): Used to improve usability<br>- Address Book (only used under Android version 3.0): Used to send push notifications<br>- Storage space: Used to store book files and reading records<br><br>\u203b Optional access permission information<br>You can use the service even if you do not agree to the access rights.<br>For users under Android 6.0, the OS does not support individual consent for access rights.<br>- Files and media (photos/videos/files): Used for adding user fonts, e-book files, sharing images, etc.<br>- Phone (outgoing call route switching): Used to automatically resume listening (TTS) function after the call ends.<br>- Notifications (Android version 13.0 or higher only): Used to notify events, benefits, work download completion, etc.",
